cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use NeuroScope-RANO in academic research, clinical studies, or AI
  segmentation benchmarking, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: >-
  NeuroScope-RANO: Zero-Upload Browser-Local Neuro-Oncology Volumetrics,
  RANO-Resect, RANO 2.0, and AI Segmentation QA Workstation
abstract: >-
  NeuroScope-RANO is a 100% client-side, zero-upload, open-access static web
  workstation for neuro-oncology imaging research and education. Built with
  zero-build HTML5, CSS3, and native ES Modules, it provides native NIfTI-1
  (.nii/.nii.gz) parsing, synchronized multi-planar and 3D MIP/surface
  visualization, BraTS 2023/2024 + post-operative tumor volumetrics, automated
  2D RANO maximal perpendicular diameters, RANO-Resect extent-of-resection
  classification, RANO 2.0 longitudinal response assessment, and exact
  anisotropic 3D AI segmentation quality assurance (Dice, IoU, HD95, ASSD, and
  TP/FP/FN error overlays).
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "Open Neuro-Oncology Contributors"
keywords:
  - neuro-oncology
  - glioblastoma
  - RANO 2.0
  - RANO-Resect
  - BraTS
  - NIfTI
  - medical-imaging
  - tumor-volumetrics
  - extent-of-resection
  - segmentation-evaluation
  - neurosurgery
  - neuroradiology
  - open-science
